{"3970010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ectorider", "steam_appid": 3970010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world at full speed with your electromagnetic gadgets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ectorider is a fast-paced 3D platformer combining Extreme Sports and Third Person Shooter. Fight a robot army with your super magnet or use them to do insane tricks with your rollerblades. Save the Ectomorphs and stop Professor Ektos evil plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELECTROMAGNETIC SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powers of the super magnet to grab, throw, propell yourself at fullspeed, fly high in the air or smash robots into them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTREME ROLLERBLADING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, grind, and soar through levels on high-speed rollers. Chain tricks, wall-runs, and aerial stunts to keep your momentum flowing and your style sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH YOUR CREATIVITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each enemies special ability, unlock new gadgets and combine them to find alternate paths into each levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FUNNY BUT DEEP STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has been changed to Ectomorphs by the evil Professor Ektos! You must race at full speed around the world with your group of friends to find them, fight Ektos robot army and turn them back into humans.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world at full speed with your electromagnetic gadgets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ectorider is a fast-paced 3D platformer combining Extreme Sports and Third Person Shooter. Fight a robot army with your super magnet or use them to do insane tricks with your rollerblades. Save the Ectomorphs and stop Professor Ektos evil plan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELECTROMAGNETIC SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/9bbb7bd2b72ebf2ba59e089fa0786fc4.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powers of the super magnet to grab, throw, propell yourself at fullspeed, fly high in the air or smash robots into them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTREME ROLLERBLADING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/bfcd789c921dd585f2121fb9550f8dd8.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, grind, and soar through levels on high-speed rollers. Chain tricks, wall-runs, and aerial stunts to keep your momentum flowing and your style sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH YOUR CREATIVITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/dc29e3733310bad9c1695e5361813ae4.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each enemies special ability, unlock new gadgets and combine them to find alternate paths into each levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FUNNY BUT DEEP STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.poster.avif?t=1773921187\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.webm?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/extras/44b96aa2ff8de0c5776c7f6ea9509a2e.mp4?t=1773921187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has been changed to Ectomorphs by the evil Professor Ektos! You must race at full speed around the world with your group of friends to find them, fight Ektos robot army and turn them back into humans.</p>", "short_description": "Ectorider is a fast-paced 3D platformer combining Extreme Sports and Third Person Shooter. Fight a robot army with your super magnet or use them to do insane tricks with your rollerblades. Save the Ectomorphs and stop Professor Ektos evil plan.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/607799015877c7fce048f2610a6219038b9a19b0/header.jpg?t=1773921187", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/1ef8bde0c4755fa0afe123b0e75bef02deff0fd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773921187", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970010/1ef8bde0c4755fa0afe123b0e75bef02deff0fd5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773921187", "website": "https://www.ectorider.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050, 8 GB or AMD Radeon RX Vega 56, 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Taldius"], "publishers": ["Taldius"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "c